    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Artis is delighted to present to the market this stunning large top floor apartment set in the sought after Swiftwood development. Extending to a very generous circa 83.3 sq.m/896 sq.ft  this luxurious apartment has the benefit of French doors opening from the living area to a large, balcony terrace with westerly aspect overlooking the car park. Throughout the property there are generous proportions and wonderful quality of light abounds. Viewing is strongly recommended.\r\nUpon entering the property, one is welcomed by a bright entrance hall leading to all the principal rooms of the property. The bright large living/dining room sits at the end of the hallway and boasts French doors leading to the balcony and large windows with a gas fire and sandstone fire surround. Set just off the living dining area a modern well-equipped kitchen with granite worktop and high gloss white wall and floor units has the benefit of modern built-in appliances. The main bedroom has the benefit of a well equipped ensuite with corner shower unit and a built-in wardrobe. A second double bedroom also opens to the terrace. Completing the accommodation is a stylish bathroom with bath and shower screen, a utility room, and a storage cupboard.\r\nOutside there is a large balcony/terrace with a westerly aspect. There is ample resident and visitor parking in the development.\r\nSwiftwood is located in a private, gated cul de sac development off Garter Lane. The property is ideally located a few minutes walk from both Saggart village and City West Shopping Centre. There are excellent transport links with Luas stops at Saggart within short walking distance and the N7 a moments' drive away. There are excellent amenities in the area with schools, shops and leisure facilities all close by. Citywest Hotel leisure centre and Golf Club is adjacent. \r\n\r\n\r\nMANAGEMENT COMPANY\r\nSwiftwood Management Limited\r\nService Charge: €1,653.48\r\n\r\n\r\nBER DETAILS\r\nRating: B2\r\nBER No: 107379521\r\nEnergy Performance Rating: 100.54 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall\r\nLaminate floor, ceiling lights, intercom, staircase to first floor.\r\n \r\nStoreroom\r\nLaminate floor, ceiling light, water tank.\r\n\r\nUtility room\r\nWater tank, ceiling light, laminate floor. Indesit washer/dryer, heating controls, Immergas gas boiler, fuse board.\r\n \r\nBathroom\r\nTiled floor and walls, bath, pedestal sink, W.C, mirror, extractor fan, recessed lighting.\r\n \r\nLiving room\r\nLaminate floor, ceiling light, recessed lighting, feature limestone fire surround with inset gas fire and granite hearth, French doors to balcony.\r\n \r\nKitchen\r\nTiled floor and splashback, built in wall and floor units, granite worktop and upstand, Beko integrated oven, integrated microwave, PowerPoint dishwasher, four ring electric hob, Beko 70:30 fridge freezer, stainless steel sink, recessed lighting, pull out larder drawers, Candy extractor fan.\r\n \r\nBathroom\r\nTiled floor and walls, bath, bath screen, wall mounted sink, W.C, mirror, extractor fan, shaving light, recessed lighting, chrome towel ring.\r\n \r\nUtility room\r\nCeiling light, plumbed for washing machine, extractor fan, built in storage, inner gas boiler.\r\n \r\nBedroom 1\r\nLaminate floor, ceiling light.\r\n \r\nEnsuite\r\nTiled floor and walls, pedestal sink, glass and chrome corner shower enclosure, ceiling light, convector heater, mirror, w.c, extractor fan.\r\n \r\nBedroom 2\r\nLaminate floor, ceiling light, curtain pole, large built-in wardrobe.\r\n \r\nBalcony \r\n4.18 x 1.76"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
